v class="heading-lockup_content-wrapper"><div class="heading-lockup_inner-wrapper"><div data-wf--atom-heading-text--content-size="heading-two" class="heading_wrap"><h2 cc-number="20" class="u-heading w-variant-2856ca8c-1473-14d3-651a-8ba7f9573f52">Frequently asked questions</h2></div><p class="section_sub-heading">If you have any additional questions, <a href="https://help.typeform.com/hc/en-us">visit our help center</a>.</p></div></div><div class="action-bar_wrapper"><div class="content-list_button-wrapper"></div></div></div></div></section><section data-theme="default" data-padding-top="large" data-padding-bottom="large" data-section-radius="none" class="s_faqs_wrap"><div class="container grid u-z-index-2"><div id="w-node-_6dd568c4-b982-38dd-0de8-aa4c69cde414-69cde412" class="faqs_container"><div cc-accordion-element="list" id="w-node-_6dd568c4-b982-38dd-0de8-aa4c69cde417-69cde412" class="faqs_list"><div itemtype="https://schema.org/Question" cc-accordion-element="accordion" cc-schema-element="faq" itemscope="" itemprop="mainEntity" class="faq-accordion_wrap" open=""><button aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="accordion-details-1" id="accordion-summary-1" cc-accordion-element="trigger" cc-schema-element="question" class="faq-accordion_top-container" role="button" tabindex="0"><h3 itemprop="name" class="u-heading-xxs">What are the benefits of a paid vs free plan?</h3><div cc-accordion-element="icon" class="faq-accordion_icon w-embed" style="transform: rotate(180deg);"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" aria-hidden="true" role="img">
<path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M12.7803 5.88971C13.0732 6.18261 13.0732 6.65748 12.7803 6.95037L8.88387 10.8468C8.39572 11.335 7.60426 11.335 7.11611 10.8468L3.21967 6.95037C2.92678 6.65748 2.92678 6.18261 3.21967 5.88971C3.51256 5.59682 3.98744 5.59682 4.28033 5.88971L7.99999 9.60938L11.7197 5.88971C12.0126 5.59682 12.4874 5.59682 12.7803 5.88971Z" fill="currentColor"></path>
</svg></div></button><div id="accordion-details-1" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-summary-1" cc-accordion-element="content" cc-schema-element="answer" class="faq-accordion_bottom-container" style="height: 80px; opacity: 1;"><div itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" itemscope=" " itemprop="acceptedAnswer" class="faq-accordion_content-wrapper"><div itemprop="text" class="content-rich-text w-richtext"><p>Paid plans unlock powerful features, more responses, and tons of customization options, making it easier and faster for you to collect valuable data and take action on it.</p></div></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="faq-accordion_spacer"></div></div></div><div itemtype="https://schema.org/Question" cc-accordion-element="accordion" cc-schema-element="faq" itemscope="" itemprop="mainEntity" class="faq-accordion_wrap"><button aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-details-2" id="accordion-summary-2" cc-accordion-element="trigger" cc-schema-element="question" class="faq-accordion_top-container" role="button" tabindex="0"><h3 itemprop="name" class="u-heading-xxs">What’s included in the free plan?</h3><div cc-accordion-element="icon" class="faq-accordion_icon w-embed" style="transform: rotate(0deg);"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" aria-hidden="true" role="img">
<path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M12.7803 5.88971C13.0732 6.18261 13.0732 6.65748 12.7803 6.95037L8.88387 10.8468C8.39572 11.335 7.60426 11.335 7.11611 10.8468L3.21967 6.95037C2.92678 6.65748 2.92678 6.18261 3.21967 5.88971C3.51256 5.59682 3.98744 5.59682 4.28033 5.88971L7.99999 9.60938L11.7197 5.88971C12.0126 5.59682 12.4874 5.59682 12.7803 5.88971Z" fill="currentColor"></path>
</svg></div></button><div id="accordion-details-2" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-summary-2" cc-accordion-element="content" cc-schema-element="answer" class="faq-accordion_bottom-container" style="height: 0px; opacity: 0;"><div itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" itemscope=" " itemprop="acceptedAnswer" class="faq-accordion_content-wrapper"><div itemprop="text" class="content-rich-text w-richtext"><p>The free plan is a great way to explore Typeform and get a feel for how Typeform can help grow your business. It includes basic features with a limited number of responses per month. Once you’ve got a feel for the platform, upgrading to more advanced features is just a few clicks!</p></div></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="faq-accordion_spacer"></div></div></div><div class="faqs_slot slot"><div itemtype="https://schema.org/Question" cc-accordion-element="accordion" cc-schema-element="faq" itemscope="" itemprop="mainEntity" class="faq-accordion_wrap"><button aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-details-3" id="accordion-summary-3" cc-accordion-element="trigger" cc-schema-element="question" class="faq-accordion_top-container" role="button" tabindex="0"><h3 itemprop="name" class="u-heading-xxs">Can I upgrade, downgrade or switch between plans?</h3><div cc-accordion-element="icon" class="faq-accordion_icon w-embed" style="transform: rotate(0deg);"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" aria-hidden="true" role="img">
<path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M12.7803 5.88971C13.0732 6.18261 13.0732 6.65748 12.7803 6.95037L8.88387 10.8468C8.39572 11.335 7.60426 11.335 7.11611 10.8468L3.21967 6.95037C2.92678 6.65748 2.92678 6.18261 3.21967 5.88971C3.51256 5.59682 3.98744 5.59682 4.28033 5.88971L7.99999 9.60938L11.7197 5.88971C12.0126 5.59682 12.4874 5.59682 12.7803 5.88971Z" fill="currentColor"></path>
</svg></div></button><div id="accordion-details-3" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-summary-3" cc-accordion-element="content" cc-schema-element="answer" class="faq-accordion_bottom-container" style="height: 0px; opacity: 0;"><div itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" itemscope=" " itemprop="acceptedAnswer" class="faq-accordion_content-wrapper"><div itemprop="text" class="content-rich-text w-richtext"><p>Yes, you can upgrade, downgrade or switch between plans at any time. We’ve noticed our customers often upgrade as their businesses grow and the complexity of their use cases requires additional features. Typeform scales as you grow.</p></div></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="faq-accordion_spacer"></div></div></div><div itemtype="https://schema.org/Question" cc-accordion-element="accordion" cc-schema-element="faq" itemscope="" itemprop="mainEntity" class="faq-accordion_wrap"><button aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-details-4" id="accordion-summary-4" cc-accordion-element="trigger" cc-schema-element="question" class="faq-accordion_top-container" role="button" tabindex="0"><h3 itemprop="name" class="u-heading-xxs">Can I pause a paid subscription?</h3><div cc-accordion-element="icon" class="faq-accordion_icon w-embed" style="transform: rotate(0deg);"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" aria-hidden="true" role="img">
<path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M12.7803 5.88971C13.0732 6.18261 13.0732 6.65748 12.7803 6.95037L8.88387 10.8468C8.39572 11.335 7.60426 11.335 7.11611 10.8468L3.21967 6.95037C2.92678 6.65748 2.92678 6.18261 3.21967 5.88971C3.51256 5.59682 3.98744 5.59682 4.28033 5.88971L7.99999 9.60938L11.7197 5.88971C12.0126 5.59682 12.4874 5.59682 12.7803 5.88971Z" fill="currentColor"></path>
</svg></div></button><div id="accordion-details-4" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-summary-4" cc-accordion-element="content" cc-schema-element="answer" class="faq-accordion_bottom-container" style="height: 0px; opacity: 0;"><div itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" itemscope=" " itemprop="acceptedAnswer" class="faq-accordion_content-wrapper"><div itemprop="text" class="content-rich-text w-richtext"><p>While you currently cannot pause a prepaid subscription, if for some reason you need to lower your usage we recommend just downgrading your plan vs cancelling. We understand some seasons are busier than others.</p></div></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="faq-accordion_spacer"></div></div></div><div itemtype="https://schema.org/Question" cc-accordion-element="accordion" cc-schema-element="faq" itemscope="" itemprop="mainEntity" class="faq-accordion_wrap"><button aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-details-5" id="accordion-summary-5" cc-accordion-element="trigger" cc-schema-element="question" class="faq-accordion_top-container" role="button" tabindex="0"><h3 itemprop="name" class="u-heading-xxs">Do you offer discounts if I pay yearly instead of monthly?</h3><div cc-accordion-element="icon" class="faq-accordion_icon w-embed" style="transform: rotate(0deg);"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" aria-hidden="true" role="img">
<path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M12.7803 5.88971C13.0732 6.18261 13.0732 6.65748 12.7803 6.95037L8.88387 10.8468C8.39572 11.335 7.60426 11.335 7.11611 10.8468L3.21967 6.95037C2.92678 6.65748 2.92678 6.18261 3.21967 5.88971C3.51256 5.59682 3.98744 5.59682 4.28033 5.88971L7.99999 9.60938L11.7197 5.88971C12.0126 5.59682 12.4874 5.59682 12.7803 5.88971Z" fill="currentColor"></path>
</svg></div></button><div id="accordion-details-5" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-summary-5" cc-accordion-element="content" cc-schema-element="answer" class="faq-accordion_bottom-container" style="height: 0px; opacity: 0;"><div itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" itemscope=" " itemprop="acceptedAnswer" class="faq-accordion_content-wrapper"><div itemprop="text" class="content-rich-text w-richtext"><p>Yes, for annual plans you will receive a discount. Depending on the plan you select, you could be saving up to 16% with an annual plan.</p></div></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="faq-accordion_spacer"></div></div></div><div itemtype="https://schema.org/Question" cc-accordion-element="accordion" cc-schema-element="faq" itemscope="" itemprop="mainEntity" class="faq-accordion_wrap"><button aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-details-6" id="accordion-summary-6" cc-accordion-element="trigger" cc-schema-element="question" class="faq-accordion_top-container" role="button" tabindex="0"><h3 itemprop="name" class="u-heading-xxs">Is there a limit to the number of responses I can collect?</h3><div cc-accordion-element="icon" class="faq-accordion_icon w-embed" style="transform: rotate(0deg);"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" aria-hidden="true" role="img">
<path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M12.7803 5.88971C13.0732 6.18261 13.0732 6.65748 12.7803 6.95037L8.88387 10.8468C8.39572 11.335 7.60426 11.335 7.11611 10.8468L3.21967 6.95037C2.92678 6.65748 2.92678 6.18261 3.21967 5.88971C3.51256 5.59682 3.98744 5.59682 4.28033 5.88971L7.99999 9.60938L11.7197 5.88971C12.0126 5.59682 12.4874 5.59682 12.7803 5.88971Z" fill="currentColor"></path>
</svg></div></button><div id="accordion-details-6" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-summary-6" cc-accordion-element="content" cc-schema-element="answer" class="faq-accordion_bottom-container" style="height: 0px; opacity: 0;"><div itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" itemscope=" " itemprop="acceptedAnswer" class="faq-accordion_content-wrapper"><div itemprop="text" class="content-rich-text w-richtext"><p>Each plan includes a set number of responses per month, with different limits depending on the plan selected. Need more? No problem. You can easily upgrade to collect even more responses.</p><p>‍</p><p>If you’re looking to collect over 50,000 responses/month, <a href="https://tfsales.typeform.com/to/lhcebvr6?source=website&amp;source2=public%20pricing%20page&amp;_gl=1*xvipgj*_gcl_au*MTUwOTEwOTQzOS4xNzQzNTIwMTYw">just reach out to our sales team</a>—we’ll work with you to create a custom plan that’s tailored to your specific business needs.</p></div></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="faq-accordion_spacer"></div></div></div><div itemtype="https://schema.org/Question" cc-accordion-element="accordion" cc-schema-element="faq" itemscope="" itemprop="mainEntity" class="faq-accordion_wrap"><button aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-details-7" id="accordion-summary-7" cc-accordion-element="trigger" cc-schema-element="question" class="faq-accordion_top-container" role="button" tabindex="0"><h3 itemprop="name" class="u-heading-xxs">What happens if I cancel my subscription?</h3><div cc-accordion-element="icon" class="faq-accordion_icon w-embed" style="transform: rotate(0deg);"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" aria-hidden="true" role="img">
<path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M12.7803 5.88971C13.0732 6.18261 13.0732 6.65748 12.7803 6.95037L8.88387 10.8468C8.39572 11.335 7.60426 11.335 7.11611 10.8468L3.21967 6.95037C2.92678 6.65748 2.92678 6.18261 3.21967 5.88971C3.51256 5.59682 3.98744 5.59682 4.28033 5.88971L7.99999 9.60938L11.7197 5.88971C12.0126 5.59682 12.4874 5.59682 12.7803 5.88971Z" fill="currentColor"></path>
</svg></div></button><div id="accordion-details-7" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-summary-7" cc-accordion-element="content" cc-schema-element="answer" class="faq-accordion_bottom-container" style="height: 0px; opacity: 0;"><div itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" itemscope=" " itemprop="acceptedAnswer" class="faq-accordion_content-wrapper"><div itemprop="text" class="content-rich-text w-richtext"><p>The changes will take effect at the end of the prepaid period. Your forms and previously collected responses will not be deleted after the paid plan expires. However, depending on your plan change, your forms may be closed to new responses and seat count reduced.</p></div></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="faq-accordion_spacer"></div></div></div><div itemtype="https://schema.org/Question" cc-accordion-element="accordion" cc-schema-element="faq" itemscope="" itemprop="mainEntity" class="faq-accordion_wrap"><button aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-details-8" id="accordion-summary-8" cc-accordion-element="trigger" cc-schema-element="question" class="faq-accordion_top-container" role="button" tabindex="0"><h3 itemprop="name" class="u-heading-xxs">How secure is Typeform?</h3><div cc-accordion-element="icon" class="faq-accordion_icon w-embed" style="transform: rotate(0deg);"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" aria-hidden="true" role="img">
<path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M12.7803 5.88971C13.0732 6.18261 13.0732 6.65748 12.7803 6.95037L8.88387 10.8468C8.39572 11.335 7.60426 11.335 7.11611 10.8468L3.21967 6.95037C2.92678 6.65748 2.92678 6.18261 3.21967 5.88971C3.51256 5.59682 3.98744 5.59682 4.28033 5.88971L7.99999 9.60938L11.7197 5.88971C12.0126 5.59682 12.4874 5.59682 12.7803 5.88971Z" fill="currentColor"></path>
</svg></div></button><div id="accordion-details-8" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-summary-8" cc-accordion-element="content" cc-schema-element="answer" class="faq-accordion_bottom-container" style="height: 0px; opacity: 0;"><div itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" itemscope=" " itemprop="acceptedAnswer" class="faq-accordion_content-wrapper"><div itemprop="text" class="content-rich-text w-richtext"><p>The security and integrity of your data are critically important for us, and we’ve built our services around this idea. Once your information enters Typeform’s systems (located in AWS), it’s secured with multiple levels of encryption and access controls, for example:</p><p>‍<br></p><ul role="list"><li>Your data in-transit is encrypted using secure TLS cryptographic protocols (TLS 1.2).</li><li>Your data at rest is encrypted using Advanced Encryption Standard (AES) with a 256-bit key.</li><li>Redundant backups of critical data are also in place to ensure business continuity in case of disaster.</li></ul><p>‍</p><p>For more detail on the security measures, please visit <a href="https://help.typeform.com/hc/en-us/articles/360029259552-Security-at-Typeform?_gl=1*1vtalac*_gcl_au*MTUwOTEwOTQzOS4xNzQzNTIwMTYw">Security at Typeform</a>.</p></div></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="faq-accordion_spacer"></div></div></div><div itemtype="https://schema.org/Question" cc-accordion-element="accordion" cc-schema-element="faq" itemscope="" itemprop="mainEntity" class="faq-accordion_wrap"><button aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-details-9" id="accordion-summary-9" cc-accordion-element="trigger" cc-schema-element="question" class="faq-accordion_top-container" role="button" tabindex="0"><h3 itemprop="name" class="u-heading-xxs">What can I do with my data once it's collected?</h3><div cc-accordion-element="icon" class="faq-accordion_icon w-embed" style="transform: rotate(0deg);"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" aria-hidden="true" role="img">
<path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M12.7803 5.88971C13.0732 6.18261 13.0732 6.65748 12.7803 6.95037L8.88387 10.8468C8.39572 11.335 7.60426 11.335 7.11611 10.8468L3.21967 6.95037C2.92678 6.65748 2.92678 6.18261 3.21967 5.88971C3.51256 5.59682 3.98744 5.59682 4.28033 5.88971L7.99999 9.60938L11.7197 5.88971C12.0126 5.59682 12.4874 5.59682 12.7803 5.88971Z" fill="currentColor"></path>
</svg></div></button><div id="accordion-details-9" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-summary-9" cc-accordion-element="content" cc-schema-element="answer" class="faq-accordion_bottom-container" style="height: 0px; opacity: 0;"><div itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" itemscope=" " itemprop="acceptedAnswer" class="faq-accordion_content-wrapper"><div itemprop="text" class="content-rich-text w-richtext"><p>Your data is all yours to explore! Dive into your responses in our Results area, create stunning reports, and easily share them with colleagues or your team.</p><p>‍</p><p>Plus, Typeform seamlessly integrates with hundreds of apps, opening up endless possibilities to supercharge your workflow.</p><p>‍</p><p>For the tech-savvy, you can take it a step further—set up webhooks and tap into our powerful APIs to craft custom solutions that perfectly fit your business. Check out our Developer Portal to get started!</p><p>‍</p></div></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="faq-accordion_spacer"></div></div></div><div itemtype="https://schema.org/Question" cc-accordion-element="accordion" cc-schema-element="faq" itemscope="" itemprop="mainEntity" class="faq-accordion_wrap"><button aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-details-10" id="accordion-summary-10" cc-accordion-element="trigger" cc-schema-element="question" class="faq-accordion_top-container" role="button" tabindex="0"><h3 itemprop="name" class="u-heading-xxs">I have additional questions, who do I contact?</h3><div cc-accordion-element="icon" class="faq-accordion_icon w-embed" style="transform: rotate(0deg);"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" aria-hidden="true" role="img">
<path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M12.7803 5.88971C13.0732 6.18261 13.0732 6.65748 12.7803 6.95037L8.88387 10.8468C8.39572 11.335 7.60426 11.335 7.11611 10.8468L3.21967 6.95037C2.92678 6.65748 2.92678 6.18261 3.21967 5.88971C3.51256 5.59682 3.98744 5.59682 4.28033 5.88971L7.99999 9.60938L11.7197 5.88971C12.0126 5.59682 12.4874 5.59682 12.7803 5.88971Z" fill="currentColor"></path>
</svg></div></button><div id="accordion-details-10" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-summary-10" cc-accordion-element="content" cc-schema-element="answer" class="faq-accordion_bottom-container" style="height: 0px; opacity: 0;"><div itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" itemscope=" " itemprop="acceptedAnswer" class="faq-accordion_content-wrapper"><div itemprop="text" class="content-rich-text w-richtext"><p>We’ve here to help you. Drop <a href="https://help.typeform.com/hc/en-us/requests/new">us a request</a><a href="mailto:help@typeform.com"></a> and we’ll reach out to you as soon as possible.</p></div></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="faq-accordion_spacer"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="cc_section-faqs_code code w-embed w-script"><script>
(function() {
  if (window.accordionSetupComplete) {
    debug('Accordion setup already completed.');
    return;
  }

  window.accordionSetupComplete = true;
  debug('Accordion script loaded.');

  function setupAccordions() {
    let pageAccordionCount = 0;

    // Get all accordion lists
    const accordionLists = document.querySelectorAll('[cc-accordion-element="list"]');
    debug(`Found ${accordionLists.length} accordion list(s).`);

    accordionLists.forEach((accordionList, listIndex) => {
      if (!accordionList) {
        debugError(`Accordion list at index ${listIndex} not found or invalid.`);
        return;
      }

      const accordions = accordionList.querySelectorAll('[cc-accordion-element="accordion"]');
      debug(`List ${listIndex + 1}: Found ${accordions.length} accordion(s).`);
      const triggerButtons = Array.from(accordionList.querySelectorAll('[cc-accordion-element="trigger"]'));

      // Set up accessibility attributes for each accordion
      accordions.forEach((accordion, index) => {
        pageAccordionCount++;

        if (!accordion) {
          debugError(`Accordion at index ${index} in list ${listIndex + 1} not found or invalid.`);
          return;
        }

        const trigger = accordion.querySelector('[cc-accordion-element="trigger"]');
        const content = accordion.querySelector('[cc-accordion-element="content"]');
        const icon = accordion.querySelector('[cc-accordion-element="icon"]');

        if (!trigger) {
          debugError(`Trigger element not found in accordion ${index + 1} of list ${listIndex + 1}.`);
          return;
        }
        if (!content) {
          debugError(`Content element not found in accordion ${index + 1} of list ${listIndex + 1}.`);
          return;
        }
        if (!icon) {
          debugWarn(`Icon element not found in accordion ${index + 1} of list ${listIndex + 1} (optional).`);
        }

        // Create and set unique IDs
        const triggerSummaryId = `accordion-summary-${pageAccordionCount}`;
        const contentDetailsId = `accordion-details-${pageAccordionCount}`;

        // Set ARIA attributes
        trigger.setAttribute('role', 'button');
        trigger.setAttribute('tabindex', '0');
        trigger.setAttribute('aria-controls', contentDetailsId);
        trigger.setAttribute('id', triggerSummaryId);

        content.setAttribute('id', contentDetailsId);
        content.setAttribute('aria-labelledby', triggerSummaryId);
        content.setAttribute('role', 'region');

        // Initial setup - first accordion open, others closed
        if (index === 0) {
          trigger.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'true');
          content.style.height = `${content.scrollHeight}px`;
          content.style.opacity = '1';
          if (icon) icon.style.transform = 'rotate(180deg)';
          accordion.setAttribute('open', '');
        } else {
          trigger.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false');
          content.style.height = '0px';
          content.style.opacity = '0';
          if (icon) icon.style.transform = 'rotate(0deg)';
          accordion.removeAttribute('open');
        }

        // Toggle function
        const toggleAccordion = (targetAccordion) => {
          const targetTrigger = targetAccordion.querySelector('[cc-accordion-element="trigger"]');
          const targetContent = targetAccordion.querySelector('[cc-accordion-element="content"]');
          const targetIcon = targetAccordion.querySelector('[cc-accordion-element="icon"]');
          const isExpanded = targetTrigger.getAttribute('aria-expanded') === 'true';

          // Collapse other accordions
          accordions.forEach(otherAccordion => {
            if (otherAccordion !== targetAccordion) {
              const otherTrigger = otherAccordion.querySelector('[cc-accordion-element="trigger"]');
              const otherContent = otherAccordion.querySelector('[cc-accordion-element="content"]');
              const otherIcon = otherAccordion.querySelector('[cc-accordion-element="icon"]');

              otherTrigger.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false');
              otherContent.style.height = '0px';
              otherContent.style.opacity = '0';
              if (otherIcon) otherIcon.style.transform = 'rotate(0deg)';
              otherAccordion.removeAttribute('open');

              // Dispatch close event
              window.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('accordionClose', {
                detail: {
                  accordionElement: otherAccordion,
                  index: Array.from(accordions).indexOf(otherAccordion)
                }
              }));
            }
          });

          // Toggle target accordion
          targetTrigger.setAttribute('aria-expanded', !isExpanded);

          if (!isExpanded) {
            targetContent.style.height = `${targetContent.scrollHeight}px`;
            targetContent.style.opacity = '1';
            if (targetIcon) targetIcon.style.transform = 'rotate(180deg)';
            targetAccordion.setAttribute('open', '');

            // Dispatch open event
            window.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('accordionOpen', {
              detail: {
                accordionElement: targetAccordion,
                index: Array.from(accordions).indexOf(targetAccordion)
              }
            }));
          } else {
            targetContent.style.height = '0px';
            targetContent.style.opacity = '0';
            if (targetIcon) targetIcon.style.transform = 'rotate(0deg)';
            targetAccordion.removeAttribute('open');

            // Dispatch close event
            window.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('accordionClose', {
              detail: {
                accordionElement: targetAccordion,
                index: Array.from(accordions).indexOf(targetAccordion)
              }
            }));
          }
        };

        // Click handler
        trigger.addEventListener('click', () => toggleAccordion(accordion));

        // Keyboard handler
        trigger.addEventListener('keydown', (event) => {
          const currentIndex = triggerButtons.indexOf(trigger);
          switch (event.key) {
            case ' ':
            case 'Enter':
              event.preventDefault();
              toggleAccordion(accordion);
              break;
            case 'ArrowDown':
              event.preventDefault();
              triggerButtons[(currentIndex + 1) % triggerButtons.length].focus();
              break;
            case 'ArrowUp':
              event.preventDefault();
              (triggerButtons[currentIndex - 1] || triggerButtons[triggerButtons.length - 1]).focus();
              break;
            case 'Home':
              event.preventDefault();
              triggerButtons[0].focus();
              break;
            case 'End':
              event.preventDefault();
              triggerButtons[triggerButtons.length - 1].focus();
              break;
          }
        });
      });
    });

    debug('All accordions have had IDs and attributes added successfully.');

    // 🔹 Tab + Accordion integration (only if tabs exist)
    const tabButtons = document.querySelectorAll('.tabbed-content_button[role="tab"]');
    const panels = document.querySelectorAll('.tabbed-content_content-pane[role="tabpanel"]');

    if (tabButtons.length) {
      tabButtons.forEach((tabButton, index) => {
        tabButton.addEventListener('click', () => {
          setTimeout(() => {
            // Reset all accordions globally
            const allAccordions = document.querySelectorAll('[cc-accordion-element="accordion"]');
            allAccordions.forEach(acc => {
              const trigger = acc.querySelector('[cc-accordion-element="trigger"]');
              const content = acc.querySelector('[cc-accordion-element="content"]');
              const icon = acc.querySelector('[cc-accordion-element="icon"]');
              trigger.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false');
              content.style.height = '0px';
              content.style.opacity = '0';
              if (icon) icon.style.transform = 'rotate(0deg)';
              acc.removeAttribute('open');
            });

            // Open the first accordion in the active tab
            const activePanel = panels[index];
            if (!activePanel) return;

            const accordionList = activePanel.querySelector('[cc-accordion-element="list"]');
            if (!accordionList) return;

            const accordions = accordionList.querySelectorAll('[cc-accordion-element="accordion"]');
            if (!accordions.length) return;

            const firstAccordion = accordions[0];
            if (firstAccordion) {
              const trigger = firstAccordion.querySelector('[cc-accordion-element="trigger"]');
              const content = firstAccordion.querySelector('[cc-accordion-element="content"]');
              const icon = firstAccordion.querySelector('[cc-accordion-element="icon"]');
              trigger.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'true');
              content.style.height = `${content.scrollHeight}px`;
              content.style.opacity = '1';
              if (icon) icon.style.transform = 'rotate(180deg)';
              firstAccordion.setAttribute('open', '');
            }
          }, 100);
        });
      });
    }
  }

  if (document.readyState === 'loading') {
    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', setupAccordions);
  } else {
    setupAccordions();
  }
})();
</script>


<script>

/**
 * Injects a JSON-LD schema script into the document head.

function injectSchemaScript(schemaId, schemaType, schemaContent) {
  if (document.getElementById(schemaId)) return;
  
  const script = document.createElement('script');
  script.id = schemaId;
  script.type = 'application/ld+json';
  script.textContent = JSON.stringify({
    '@context': 'https://schema.org',
    '@type': schemaType,
    ...schemaContent,
  });
  
  document.head.appendChild(script);
  debug(`${schemaId} schema generated and appended to <head>.`);
}
*/
/**
 * Generates and injects FAQ schema script.

function generateFaqSchema() {
  const faqItems = document.querySelectorAll('[cc-schema-element="faq"]');
  if (!faqItems.length) {
    debugError('No FAQ items found.');
    return;
  }

  const mainEntity = Array.from(faqItems).map((item) => ({
    '@type': 'Question',
    name: item.querySelector('[cc-schema-element="question"]').textContent.trim(),
    acceptedAnswer: {
      '@type': 'Answer',
      text: item.querySelector('[cc-schema-element="answer"]').textContent.trim(),
    },
  }));

  injectSchemaScript('faq-schema', 'FAQPage', { mainEntity });
}

document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', generateFaqSchema);
 */

</script></div></section><section data-new-theme="none" data-padding-top="small" data-padding-bottom="small" data-theme="default" data-cta-type="uncontained" data-section-radius="none" class="s_cta_wrap"><div class="container"><div data-padding-bottom="large" data-padding-top="large" class="cta_container"><div data-margin-bottom="none" data-heading-orientation="center" class="heading-lockup_wrap"><div class="heading-lockup_content-wrapper"><div class="heading-lockup_inner-wrapper"><h2 class="section_heading u-heading-lg">The form is just the beginning</h2></div></div><div class="action-bar_wrapper"><div class="content-list_button-wrapper"><div class="button_wrapper"><a cc-t-item_type="button" class="button w-inline-block" cc-t-global-skip="self" setting-variant="primary" href="/signup" cc-t-event="item_clicked" cc-t-item="sign_up" cc-t-location="footer" setting-size="large"><div>Start creating</div></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></section></main><div cc-t-value="down" cc-t-event="page_navigated" cc-t-in_view="true" cc-t-in_view_allow_multipe="false" cc-t-item="scroll" cc-t-item_type="button" cc-t-location="footer" class="cc_t-pixel-in_view" data-in-view="false"><div class="pixel_label-css w-embed"><style>
